#!/bin/sh
# Size check for the one-memory layout: AGENTS.md at most 80 lines (the status file lives in savepoint-notes).
# CI runs this too. Enable locally once per clone: git config core.hooksPath .githooks
fail=0
check() {
  [ -f "$1" ] || return 0
  n=$(wc -l < "$1")
  if [ "$n" -gt "$2" ]; then
    echo "size check: $1 has $n lines (max $2). Trim it before committing." >&2
    fail=1
  fi
}
check AGENTS.md 80
exit $fail
